  "info": {
    "title": "fuaran-core-idl — the IDL stability classifier over two `idl.json` revisions.",
    "version": "0.35.2",
    "description": "Fuaran.Core.Idl.Cli — the IDL stability classifier as a command (`fuaran-core-idl`). Classifies the delta between two `idl.json` revisions: the wire severity per changed member with the reason it applies, the wire-profile evolution, and the F# consequence classes a consumer compiled against the generated structural layer meets. Exits 0 / 3 / 4 for absorbable / breaking / undecided, or asserts a declared class with `--expect`; `spike-proposal` prices a vocabulary-change proposal against a vocabulary. .NET-only and build-time; the classification it prints lives in Fuaran.Core.Idl.Codegen."
  },
